// Engine Sim V0.1.14A
// 1955 Ford Y-Block 292 V8 193 @ 4400

// 1955–1959	Ford Thunderbird
// 1955	Mercury Custom
// 1955	Mercury Monterey
// 1955	Mercury Montclair
// 1955–1956	Ford Mainline
// 1955–1956	Ford Customline
// 1955–1959	Ford Fairlane
// 1957–1959	Ford Custom 300
// 1957–1959	Ford Ranchero

// Created by oror 2025

